From 10a5e9aa34e21aa93a2fe451c0d83d236ebc70cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ashfordeOU <236818772+ashfordeOU@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:13:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] web/: a Kshana Connect card in the Studio's tools hub, and
 the Connect and adapter docs pages

The tools hub's Command line tab gains a Kshana Connect card: what Connect does (mapping files to
kshana.obs/1, growing logs, MQTT, NATS and WebSocket feeds, the test vectors, the adapter registry),
why it runs outside a page, the commands from docs/COMMANDS.md, and two recorded samples of real CLI
output: `kshana connect check conformance/connect` (6 of 6 vectors pass: three mappings and three
built-in readers) and `kshana connect adapters list adapters` (three adapters, each [example]).
No live connection is made in the browser.

docs/CONNECT.md and docs/ADAPTERS.md are published as docs/connect.html and docs/adapters.html
(the card links to the first). The site's recorders re-run at this commit's parent. i18n:
studio-js.ftl regenerated (five new strings); the two new pages' English catalogues extracted.
